      "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "Note"},
      "title": "START HERE — What This Workflow Can Tune",
      "widgets_values": ["TWO INDEPENDENT PRESET LISTS\n\nCAPTION PRESET = WHAT music to request: Country, Rock, Metal, R&B, Rap, Pop, Folk, and other musical styles. It visibly fills editable description fields.\n\nTUNING PRESET = HOW Music3 should interpret that request: strict, creative, stable, detailed, strong, loose, fast, dense, or restrained. It changes numerical backend controls.\n\nFor a clean comparison, keep the Caption preset, lyrics, and Seed A unchanged. Change only the Tuning preset and generate again.\n\nThe Tuning preset coordinates:\n• AR cfg_scale — caption/lyrics adherence\n• AR top_k — planning diversity\n• KSampler CFG — diffusion guidance\n• Steps — rendering iterations\n• Conditioning Strength — acoustic-plan emphasis\n\nThese lists are independent so changing genre does not secretly change generation behavior."]
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "type": "Note",
      "pos": [1010, 1040],
      "size": [450, 390],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 16,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "Note"},
      "title": "A/B TUNING METHOD — Change One Thing at a Time",
      "widgets_values": ["For meaningful comparisons, keep Seed A connected to BOTH Text Encode and KSampler.\n\nQUICK TEST\nA. Select Balanced / Built-in Baseline.\nB. Generate and save the result.\nC. Change only Tuning Preset to Creative Melody.\nD. Generate again with the same caption, lyrics, and seed.\nE. Compare lyric accuracy, section shape, melody, arrangement, texture, and artifacts.\n\nONE-CONTROL TEST\nDisconnect one wire from Tuning Preset to its receiving node, then compare values while everything else stays fixed.\n\nSuggested ranges:\n• AR cfg_scale: 1.2–2.2\n• AR top_k: 20–120\n• KSampler CFG: 1.3–2.1\n• Conditioning Strength: 0.80–1.25\n• Steps: 20–48\n\nExtremes can collapse into noise. More strength is not automatically better."]
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "type": "Note",
      "pos": [1500, 840],
      "size": [350, 330],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 17,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "Note"},
      "title": "Which Control Should I Change?",
      "widgets_values": ["Lyrics/sections ignored → raise AR cfg_scale slightly or lower top_k.\n\nEverything too predictable → raise top_k or lower AR cfg_scale slightly.\n\nPlan is right but rendering feels weak → raise KSampler CFG or steps modestly.\n\nWant the hidden plan emphasized → raise Conditioning Strength in 0.05 steps. Stop if transients become harsh/static.\n\nWant a different melody/arrangement → try Seed B/C/D.\n\nWant a drier, rawer result → edit production/vocal language first; numerical controls cannot guarantee mix traits."]
    },
