      "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "Note"},
      "title": "OPTIONAL BLEND — Experimental Instructions",
      "widgets_values": ["The three purple nodes are disabled/bypassed by default so they do not run.\n\nTo experiment:\n1. Enable the B Caption, B Text Encode, and Blend nodes (Mode → Always).\n2. Keep the same lyrics, duration, and seed for A and B.\n3. Disconnect A Text Encode from Conditioning Strength.\n4. Connect Blend conditioning → Conditioning Strength.\n5. Begin blend_b at 0.15–0.35.\n\nThis linearly blends hidden acoustic plans, not audio. It may combine style tendencies, but incompatible plans can become incoherent, so compare it carefully with the A-only result."]
